{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"043a6221b63377e5e6c68dcdeb4e20cf9d1689e67149dbaf87e788bda0575f79","ja":"敏腕マネージャー登場！","zh":"精明干练的经纪人登场！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"21308fe68c5cf11da4963fea189f3fa2daeaf7dfa09fad1919ef524b0aefa33c","ja":"お、お疲れ様ですぅ……。\n番組収録……だいぶ早く、終わりましたね♪","zh":"辛苦、辛苦了呜……。\n节目收录……比预计结束得早很多呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"77b5c3208ddc83f43ca7c09eba0360e27429c5b895d426becaab091e6afda0d2","ja":"トークが盛り上がったお陰ですわね。\n撮れ高がよかったそうですわよ。","zh":"多亏了聊天环节聊得很起劲呢。\n听说录到了不少好素材哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d7c2998f59360b72f53398ad5377a7ef28902e40e12886388f1128689788f547","ja":"次の仕事まで、かなり時間空いたよな。\nせっかくだから、みんなで何かしようぜ♪","zh":"距离下一项工作还有不少空闲时间呢。\n难得有空，大家一起来干点什么吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3ee725a97c9dee055eb386edc0ce5ebcf7771079de69f88755f90c1cf2c42cda","ja":"でしたら、わたくしに任せてくださいな。\n空き時間を過ごす方法を考えてきましたから。","zh":"既然如此，就请交给我吧。\n我已经想好打发空闲时间的办法了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fc13692a64f986d5a18cb850bf10332bed265003a71289d91a0447aeccc1a94d","ja":"ええっ……千鶴さんは、収録が早く終わるって、\nわかっていたんですか！？","zh":"咦……千鹤小姐早就知道\n录音会提早结束吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0050b59158d7103cd241ff03e6ed27791ce463fda69970318f6ea4b3f0209cf1","ja":"そうではありませんが、元々、少し時間が空く\nスケジュールだったので、調べてましたの。","zh":"倒也不是那样，不过原本就有一段空闲\n时间的行程，所以我就顺便查了一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"06646889e74a534f8d0cf87e65bad285a3c17f601b77646f69f2b3c4d0c57258","ja":"ふぉぉぉ！　アイドルちゃんのスケジュールを把握して\n時間を有効に使おうとするなんて……。","zh":"呼喔喔！竟然会掌握偶像们的日程安排，\n想要有效利用时间……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"067a68be08c9850f8d8effd4f4b15b8f4b44d59defd75b7689c26fe53e35fb34","ja":"これはまさしく、敏腕マネージャーのお仕事！\nまるで、神宮寺さんのようですね！","zh":"这正是精明强干的经纪人的工作！\n简直就像神宫寺小姐一样呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2a95649638f321aacad287b6658a0b65e610d2eb15db447f5091e5f98cbd1b2f","ja":"あっ、確かに！\nすっごく頼もしいです、千鶴さん！","zh":"啊，确实！\n千鹤小姐，你真的好可靠啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1445.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"400ac33b3fc2a9f43fc759f0679bf46a37078d35925573f5bf0f5f1ecd8f15e1","ja":"ふふ、これくらい大したことではありませんわ♪\nでは、着替えて移動いたしましょう。","zh":"呵呵，这种程度根本不算什么♪\n那么，换好衣服就出发吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
